1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,794
Count.

2
00:00:00,794 --> 00:00:07,552
Three antipodals, two synergids, one egg, and one central cell with two nuclei.

3
00:00:07,552 --> 00:00:10,286
Seven cells, eight nuclei.

4
00:00:10,286 --> 00:00:13,268
It is the Polygonum type embryo sac.

5
00:00:13,268 --> 00:00:16,875
Monosporic, because it grows from one megaspore.

6
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:19,934
Over eighty percent of flowering plants have it.

